{"title": "Dreamlike Aura: Fire", "pageid": 50318, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dreamlike_Aura:_Fire", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dreamlike Aura: Fire</b> is a passive feature exclusive to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Hallucination_(creature)\" title=\"Fire Hallucination (creature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png/25px-Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png/38px-Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png/50px-Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Hallucinations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png/25px-Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Fire_Hallucination.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Hallucination_(creature)\" title=\"Fire Hallucination (creature)\">Fire Hallucinations</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Staying close to this creature grants <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/4